#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/testing/ir/index.rst:34
msgid ""
"A module query visits all PrimFunc bodies unless ``function`` selects one by "
"global name. Other module functions are skipped. Function signatures and "
"module metadata are not traversed. Shared nodes are visited once per body."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/testing/ir/index.rst:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/testing/ir/index.rst:0
msgid "Return type"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/testing/ir/index.rst:43
msgid ""
"GlobalVar and other non-Op callees do not match. An unregistered name raises "
"the Op registry's error instead of silently producing an empty result. "
"Consecutive queries of the same body share an internal LRU index. A new body "
"rebuilds the index, including after replacing a module function. The "
"returned list can be changed without affecting subsequent queries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/testing/ir/index.rst:54
msgid ""
"Reuse the same internal body index as collect_calls. Function selection is "
"resolved anew on every query; diagnostic ownership is read on failure."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/testing/ir/index.rst:62
msgid ""
"Other call operators, missing arguments and non-string symbols do not match. "
"This function does not interpret prefixes, templates or regular expressions. "
"Reuse the same internal body index through collect_calls."
msgstr ""
